WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.833
We are cleared for landing in Gridiron Heights

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:04.666
Welcome back to football, everyone

00:00:04.666 --> 00:00:05.916
You like that?

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:06.666
YOU LIKE THAT?!!!

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:09.750
We remind you this is a non-smoking league

00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:14.458
Doing great, Ice Man

00:00:14.458 --> 00:00:18.166
Just got to land this bad boy like we've practiced
a thousand times before

00:00:18.166 --> 00:00:19.125
No problem, Coach

00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:21.166
Can you give me a read on the approach vectors?

00:00:21.166 --> 00:00:24.083
Looks like we're turning from 28 degrees west

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:26.666
Uh, heading towards 3 degrees

00:00:26.666 --> 00:00:27.875
That's 28 to 3

00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:29.541
What's that?

00:00:29.541 --> 00:00:31.541
28 to 3

00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:33.166
And perfect conditions

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.583
There's no way you could screw this landing up

00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:36.708
Yeah, totally

00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:38.750
Uh Ice?  You all right?

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.750
Matty! Matty! Matty Ice! Ice Man! You good?!

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.958
OH GOD. He’s chooooooking!!! He’s chooooking!

00:00:43.958 --> 00:00:44.791
My ankle!

00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:46.958
Ow, my shoulder! No one’s fault, no one’s fault, tho

00:00:47.416 --> 00:00:50.041
Is there a quarterback who can land this plane?

00:00:50.041 --> 00:00:51.375
Oh, no, sorry.  Like a real quarterback

00:00:51.375 --> 00:00:53.000
Sounds like a job for...

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.375
Smokin' Jay

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:56.000
Out of my way scrub

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.000
I got this

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:57.833
Um, let's see

00:00:57.833 --> 00:00:59.208
Ow, hurt my thumb; I'm done, I give up

